            "text": "theorem miswired_counterexample (T : ℝ) :\n    ∃ u v : ℝ → ℝ, (∀ t, u t ≤ 0.40) ∧ v 0 ∈ Icc (-0.10 : ℝ) 2.08 ∧\n      ContinuousOn v (Icc 0 T) ∧\n      (∀ t ∈ Ico (0 : ℝ) T, ∃ v' c : ℝ, HasDerivWithinAt v v' (Ici t) t ∧\n        (5 : ℝ) ≤ c ∧ c ≤ 20 ∧ |c * v' - InetSwapped nominal (u t) (v t)| ≤ 2) ∧\n      ∀ t, v t < 1.35 := by"
